,"source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"'Another universe': How Indiana football changed Bloomington","description":"The basketball haven has become a legend of the fall, where the reigning national champs take center stage.","published":"2026-11-20T16:31:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50533477/bloomington-indiana-football-town","type":"Story","byline":"Chuck Culpepper","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"SEC standardized NIL, revenue sharing contracts 'unfair' for players, agents say","description":"The SEC's new uniform NIL and revenue sharing agreements are causing an uproar among agents concerned that the contracts are loaded with terms that are unfair.","published":"2026-11-20T01:16:03.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50535591/sec-standardized-nil-contracts-unfair-players-agents-say","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Waiver approved allowing Army, Navy to play 13th game in 2027","description":"The waiver will allow Army and Navy to play 12 games apiece before the College Football Playoff selections are made and keep their rivalry game.","published":"2026-11-20T14:06:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50535192/waiver-approved-army-navy-13th-game-2027","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"James Madison moving to American Conference in 2027","description":"James Madison is leaving the Sun Belt Conference for the American Conference a year earlier than planned, in 2027 rather than 2028.","published":"2026-11-19T21:30:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534149/james-madison-moving-american-conference-2027","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4905925/devan-thompkins","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devan_Thompkins"},"pick":{"pick":31,"round":1,"team":"SF","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Devan Thompkins","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devan_Thompkins","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-18T13:13:47Z","intro":"Devan Thompkins is an American college football defensive tackle for the Alabama Crimson Tide. He previously played for the USC Trojans.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Thompkins attended St. Mary's High School in Stockton, California for three years before transferring to Edison High School in Stockton for his senior year. He played basketball at St. Mary's and did not play football until his senior year at Edison. He played defensive end and tight end in high school and had nine tackles and caught three passes for 24 yards. Thompkins committed to the University of Southern California (USC) to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Thompkins played in three combined games his first two years at USC in 2022 and 2023. In 2024, he started six of 13 games and recorded 24 tackles and 1.5 sacks. In 2025, he had 31 tackles and three sacks. After the season, Thompkins entered the transfer portal."}]}}